a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refit  the lower coolant outlet sleeve\nfrom the radiator, engine oil heat exchanger end, and tighten the\nband.</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428824\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]